### InverSeek Control Module - runnable HTTP checks
@base = http://localhost:7000

### Health -> 200 with the reachability of Ingestion and Indexing
GET {{base}}/health

### Register books -> 202 {"inserted":N,"ignored":N,"total":N}
POST {{base}}/control/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"ids": [11, 84, 1342, 9999999]}

### Register again (idempotent) -> 202, everything ignored
POST {{base}}/control/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"ids": [11, 84, 1342, 9999999]}

### Register a range -> 202
POST {{base}}/control/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"from": 100, "to": 102}

### Invalid body -> 400 {"error":"invalid_request"}
POST {{base}}/control/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"ids": []}

### One book -> 200 with state, attempts, last_error and timestamps
GET {{base}}/control/books/1342

### Book that does not exist on Gutenberg ends as NOT_FOUND
GET {{base}}/control/books/9999999

### Unregistered book -> 404 {"error":"book_not_found"}
GET {{base}}/control/books/5

### List by state, with pagination
GET {{base}}/control/books?state=INDEXED&offset=0&limit=10

### Status -> books per state, workers and active leases
GET {{base}}/control/status

### Metrics -> coordination cost per phase
GET {{base}}/control/metrics

### Retry -> 202. FAILED and NOT_FOUND restart; INDEXED is reindexed; active books give 409
POST {{base}}/control/books/1342/retry
